    {
     "@es": "El adjetivo va **delante** del sustantivo y no cambia con el plural: **a tall man**, **tall men**, **a young boy**, **a funny girl**.",
     "@en": "The adjective goes **delante** from the noun and does not change with the plural: **a tall man**, **tall men**, **a young boy**, **a funny girl**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Con **to be**: **He's tall**. Con **have got**: **She's got long hair**.",
     "@en": "With **to be**: **He's tall**. With **have got**: **She's got long hair**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Very** refuerza: **very tall** (muy alto).",
     "@en": "**Very** reinforces: **very tall** (very high)."
    }
   ]
